  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the wild and bring the legend of Bigfoot to life with this premium Bigfoot Quilt from Jeminise. Designed for adventure lovers and nature enthusiasts, this quilt offers warmth, comfort, and unique style, perfect for snuggling up or adding personality to your bedroom.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unique Bigfoot Design:</strong> Features a bold and playful Bigfoot design, ideal for nature enthusiasts, campers, or anyone who loves the great outdoors.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Quality Material:</strong> Made from a soft, durable blend of cotton and polyester for a cozy, breathable, and comfortable sleeping experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Five Size Options:</strong> Available in Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to ensure a perfect fit for every bed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile &amp; Functional:</strong> Ideal for year-round comfort, functioning as a warm blanket for cold nights or a stylish bedding piece to complement room decor.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Built to Last:</strong> Designed with high-quality stitching and vibrant, fade-resistant prints that remain sharp wash after wash.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable fabric ensures long-lasting use and easy maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> Perfect for nature lovers, hunters, or anyone who enjoys outdoor adventures and Bigfoot enthusiasts.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Cotton Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Bigfoot Say Hi</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Rodeo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern Themed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Duvet Cover (or Comforter) + (Optional) Pillowcases</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
